msgid "Local variable"
msgstr "局部变量"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:16
msgid "A computed payload"
msgstr "计算得到的载荷"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:17
msgid "One request"
msgstr "单次请求"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:18
msgid "Dictionary keyed by AgentRunContext"
msgstr "以 AgentRunContext 为键的字典"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:19
msgid "Tool approval or model-step counter"
msgstr "工具审批或模型步数计数器"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:20
msgid "One conversation"
msgstr "单个对话"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:21
msgid "Map keyed by session ID or persistent storage"
msgstr "以会话 ID 为键的映射，或持久化存储"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:22
msgid "Accumulated message history"
msgstr "累积的消息历史记录"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:23
msgid "Application process"
msgstr "应用进程"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:24
msgid "Immutable shared configuration or bounded sink"
msgstr "不可变的共享配置，或有界的汇点"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:25
msgid "Model client pool or metrics exporter"
msgstr "模型客户端连接池或指标导出器"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:27
msgid "One Agent can run different sessions concurrently. Same-session overlap is rejected. The ``agent.state`` convenience attribute points to the most recently prepared state, so it is not a safe way for a shared extension to select its request. Always use ``context.state`` passed to that hook."
msgstr "同一个 Agent 可以并发运行不同的会话。同一会话的重叠运行会被拒绝。\\ ``agent.state``\\ 这个便捷属性指向最近一次准备好的状态，因此共享的扩展不能靠它来选中自己的请求。请始终使用钩子传入的 ``context.state``\\ 。"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:32
msgid "AgentRunContext uses identity semantics, making it suitable as a request-local map key. A normal dictionary retains it strongly; remove entries on every terminal path. Do not rely on garbage collection as your cleanup protocol."
msgstr "AgentRunContext 使用身份语义，因此适合作为请求局部的映射键。普通字典会强引用它；请在每条终止路径上移除对应条目。不要依赖垃圾回收来作为你的清理机制。"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:37
msgid "Complete cleanup pattern"
msgstr "完整的清理模式"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:43
msgid "``discard``/``pop(..., None)`` make cleanup tolerant of partially initialized or already-released state. Cancellation is not an Exception subclass handled by on_error; it is delivered internally as RunCancelledEvent. Subclasses of the external-response base must preserve its cleanup by calling super()."
msgstr "``discard``/``pop(..., None)``\\ 让清理过程能容忍尚未完全初始化或已经释放的状态。取消并不是由 on_error 处理的 Exception 子类；它在内部以 RunCancelledEvent 的形式投递。外部响应基类的子类必须调用 super() 来保留它的清理逻辑。"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:49
msgid "Check early stream closure"
msgstr "检查流被提前关闭"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:55
msgid "After the context manager closes the stream, the phase is CANCELLED and the extension's active set is empty. A later request succeeds on the same Agent with a fresh state. Persisted prior messages are not automatically deleted or edited."
msgstr "上下文管理器关闭流之后，阶段为 CANCELLED，扩展的活动集合为空。之后的请求可以在同一个 Agent 上用全新的状态成功运行。已经持久化的过往消息不会被自动删除或修改。"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:60
msgid "Testing an extension before shipping"
msgstr "发布前测试扩展"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:62
msgid "At minimum, exercise:"
msgstr "至少要覆盖以下情况："

#: ../../extending/state.rst:64
msgid "Success and normal tool error."
msgstr "成功，以及正常的工具错误。"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:65
msgid "Failure before your state is fully initialized."
msgstr "状态尚未完全初始化时就发生失败。"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:66
msgid "Cancellation during model streaming and while waiting for external input."
msgstr "模型流式输出期间以及等待外部输入期间的取消。"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:67
msgid "Two sessions using the same extension instance."
msgstr "两个会话共用同一个扩展实例。"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:68
msgid "Duplicate and late external replies."
msgstr "重复和迟到的外部回复。"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:69
msgid "A second request after success, failure, and cancellation."
msgstr "成功、失败和取消之后的第二次请求。"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:70
msgid "Registration name/tool-name collisions and equal-priority ordering."
msgstr "注册名称/工具名称冲突，以及相同优先级之间的顺序。"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:72
msgid "The documentation tests run these tutorial classes, not a separate copy. The core runtime suite additionally exercises state-machine and external-event races."
msgstr "文档测试运行的就是这些教程中的类，而不是另一份副本。核心运行时测试套件还额外覆盖状态机与外部事件的竞态。"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:76
msgid "Avoid blocking async hooks"
msgstr "避免阻塞异步钩子"

#: ../../extending/state.rst:78
msgid "Do not call synchronous terminal input or slow filesystem/network operations on the event-loop thread. Use an async library or asyncio.to_thread where appropriate. Do not add your own thread lock around an await. ExternalEventExtension already handles cross-thread response delivery safely."
msgstr "不要在事件循环线程上调用同步的终端输入，或执行缓慢的文件系统/网络操作。请按情况使用异步库或 asyncio.to_thread。不要在 await 周围加自己的线程锁。ExternalEventExtension 已经安全地处理了跨线程的响应投递。"

